# R8 PRE-UAT H1-DIRECT (Owner source approval Gate A, 2026-11-19, path #102): build context of
# deploy/uat-r8/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile).
# Allowlist: only backend/ and frontend/ are sent; everything else is excluded.
*
!backend/
!frontend/
# Required at runtime although .gitignore lists `data/` (docker does not read .gitignore; stated explicitly):
!backend/app/data/

# Never send: secrets, credentials, environments, VCS data, caches, local uploads, logs, test output.
**/.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/credentials*.json
**/service-account*.json
**/.venv
**/venv
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.vite
**/*.log
backend/data
frontend/dist
frontend/dist-ssr
frontend/test-results
frontend/playwright-report
frontend/blob-report

